 },
 "paragraphs": [
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p001.s01",
     "source": "“I never read such an impious book,” said the reader, throwing it on the floor."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p001"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p002.s01",
     "source": "“You need not hurt me,” said the book; “you will only get less for me second hand, and I did not write myself.”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p002"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p003.s01",
     "source": "“That is true,” said the reader."
    },
    {
     "id": "p003.s02",
     "source": "“My quarrel is with your author.”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p003"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p004.s01",
     "source": "“Ah, well,” said the book, “you need not buy his rant.”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p004"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p005.s01",
     "source": "“That is true,” said the reader."
    },
    {
     "id": "p005.s02",
     "source": "“But I thought him such a cheerful writer.”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p005"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p006.s01",
     "source": "“I find him so,” said the book."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p006"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p007.s01",
     "source": "“You must be differently made from me,” said the reader."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p007"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p008.s01",
     "source": "“Let me tell you a fable,” said the book."
    },
    {
     "id": "p008.s02",
     "source": "“There were two men wrecked upon a desert island; one of them made believe he was at home, the other admitted—”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p008"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p009.s01",
     "source": "“Oh, I know your kind of fable,” said the reader."
    },
    {
     "id": "p009.s02",
     "source": "“They both died.”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p009"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p010.s01",
     "source": "“And so they did,” said the book."
    },
    {
     "id": "p010.s02",
     "source": "“No doubt of that."
    },
    {
     "id": "p010.s03",
     "source": "And everybody else.”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p010"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p011.s01",
     "source": "“That is true,” said the reader."
    },
    {
     "id": "p011.s02",
     "source": "“Push it a little further for this once."
    },
    {
     "id": "p011.s03",
     "source": "And when they were all dead?”"
    }
   ],
   "id": "p011"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p012.s01",
     "source": "“They were in God’s hands, the same as before,” said the book."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p012"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p013.s01",
     "source": "“Not much to boast of, by your account,” cried the reader."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p013"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p014.s01",
     "source": "“Who is impious now?” said the book."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p014"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
     "id": "p015.s01",
     "source": "And the reader put him on the fire."
    }
   ],
   "id": "p015"
  },
  {
   "type": "prose",
   "segments": [
    {
